| Method | Path                   | Description                         |
| ------ | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| GET    | `/health`              | Liveness check                      |
| GET    | `/status-codes`        | Full code → reason phrase table     |
| GET    | `/status-codes/:code`  | Reason phrase and class for a code  |
